<title>USA: Coastal Corp Q1 operating net up 23 pct.</title>
<headline>Coastal Corp Q1 operating net up 23 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper shr		    $0.91		    $0.74</p>
<p> Oper net		  101,200		   82,500</p>
<p> Revs		    3,205,800		3,097,800</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  106,800		  106,000</p>
<p>	    (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 operating net excludes loss of $90.6 million, or $0.85 per share, on early payment of debt.</p>
<p>Interest expense $79.2 million vs $95.6 million.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
